  "prompt": "Voltmarkt's store managers want to know about larger orders. For each store, how many orders placed in March 2025 (the UTC days of order_ts) held 2 or more units in all, and what was those orders' revenue (quantity times unit_price_eur minus line_discount_eur, over all their lines)? Return exactly three columns, in this order: store_code, big_orders and revenue. Return one row for each store with such orders. Any row order is fine.",
